      "text": "Administrator creates installment in UI. It is saved to DB.\nHe choses Word template. It's filled and printed to sign.\nNew payments are being added manually (no cards etc.).\nInstallment status is being tracked by Windows Service. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Administrator creates installment in UI. It is saved to DB.\nHe choses Word template. It's filled and printed to sign.\nNew payments are being added manually (no cards etc.).\nInstallment status is being tracked by Windows Service. ",
